    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Clicker Heroes meets Vampire Survivors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iconic is a frentic lane-based horde survival roguelite with innovative gameplay that rewards nimble clicking, fast reactions, and smart tactics under time pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to defend three combat lanes against waves of enemies by placing shields, actively attacking the enemies, and utilizing the available upgrades and supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/e259cdfa5bb44abeace638d877ddb160.poster.avif?t=1754893458\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/e259cdfa5bb44abeace638d877ddb160.webm?t=1754893458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27 Tactical, Skill-Based Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike common idle games with a similar setup, Iconic has a focus at rewarding actual player skill and understanding. The game demands your full attention\u2014enforcing you to act decisively, think tactically, and make smart use of your abilities and power-ups to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Deep Meta-Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, Iconic offers a complex meta game progression system and a variety of different game modes that makes it much more appealing and diverse than the typical grind-heavy horde survival roguelite titles currently on the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/f9747ab3a0d82e5fd0462ca900f35ee7.poster.avif?t=1754893458\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/f9747ab3a0d82e5fd0462ca900f35ee7.webm?t=1754893458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Smash. Slam. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click hard, click fast. Wipe out waves of enemies, juggle lanes, and keep the chaos under control. It\u2019s all about quick moves and well timed hits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle an army of merciless monster icons in this lane-based horde survival roguelite frenzy and put an end to their evil endeavors. By clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Please note that this game is still in active development.<br>Visuals, features, and gameplay are all evolving\u2014what you see now may improve, change, or be replaced entirely. If something feels missing or rough, it\u2019s probably on our list!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Clicker Heroes meets Vampire Survivors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iconic is a frentic lane-based horde survival roguelite with innovative gameplay that rewards nimble clicking, fast reactions, and smart tactics under time pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to defend three combat lanes against waves of enemies by placing shields, actively attacking the enemies, and utilizing the available upgrades and supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/e259cdfa5bb44abeace638d877ddb160.poster.avif?t=1754893458\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/e259cdfa5bb44abeace638d877ddb160.webm?t=1754893458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27 Tactical, Skill-Based Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike common idle games with a similar setup, Iconic has a focus at rewarding actual player skill and understanding. The game demands your full attention\u2014enforcing you to act decisively, think tactically, and make smart use of your abilities and power-ups to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Deep Meta-Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, Iconic offers a complex meta game progression system and a variety of different game modes that makes it much more appealing and diverse than the typical grind-heavy horde survival roguelite titles currently on the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/f9747ab3a0d82e5fd0462ca900f35ee7.poster.avif?t=1754893458\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/f9747ab3a0d82e5fd0462ca900f35ee7.webm?t=1754893458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Smash. Slam. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click hard, click fast. Wipe out waves of enemies, juggle lanes, and keep the chaos under control. It\u2019s all about quick moves and well timed hits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle an army of merciless monster icons in this lane-based horde survival roguelite frenzy and put an end to their evil endeavors. By clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Please note that this game is still in active development.<br>Visuals, features, and gameplay are all evolving\u2014what you see now may improve, change, or be replaced entirely. If something feels missing or rough, it\u2019s probably on our list!</h2>",
